</div> <section class="wow-news-section"> <div class="news-panel-wrapper"> <div class="latest-news-heading-wrapper"> <h2>Latest World of Warcraft News</h2> </div> <div class="unit-wide-pw"></div> <section class="nt-news-tiles" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-news-tiles__grid" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <article data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/news/massive-class-tuning-pass-coming-september-22nd-23-specs/" class="nt-card" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__media" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <img src="https://wp.icy-veins.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IXM5NMR2FGZ317851708595921.jpg" alt="Massive Class Tuning Pass Coming September 22nd: 23 Specs!" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> </div> <div class="nt-card__body" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__title" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Massive Class Tuning Pass Coming September 22nd: 23 Specs!</div> <p class="nt-card__meta" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> 2h ago by <span class="nt-card__author" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Starym</span> </p> </div> </a> </article><article data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/news/wow-forever-beta-known-issues-list-september-18th/" class="nt-card" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__media" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <img src="https://wp.icy-veins.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/WoW-Forever-Cinematic-Still-4.webp" alt="WoW Forever Beta Known Issues List: September 18th" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> </div> <div class="nt-card__body" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__title" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>WoW Forever Beta Known Issues List: September 18th</div> <p class="nt-card__meta" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> 7h ago by <span class="nt-card__author" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Starym</span> </p> </div> </a> </article><article data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/news/heres-the-full-range-of-skyborne-customizations-in-wow-fore