er Beta Faces Launch Issues, Blizzard Is Working On It</div> <p class="nt-card__meta" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> 1d ago by <span class="nt-card__author" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Tharid</span> </p> </div> </a> </article><article data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/news/the-wow-forever-beta-is-live/" class="nt-card" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__media" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <img src="https://wp.icy-veins.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/4999cb48-308f-4fb8-8e3b-8ba5d67ce5ae.jpg" alt="The WoW Forever Beta is Live!" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> </div> <div class="nt-card__body" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__title" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>The WoW Forever Beta is Live!</div> <p class="nt-card__meta" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> 1d ago by <span class="nt-card__author" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Tharid</span> </p> </div> </a> </article><article data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/wow-forever/news/blizzard-just-confirmed-gdkp-runs-wont-be-allowed-in-wow-forever/" class="nt-card" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__media" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <img src="https://wp.icy-veins.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/gdkpseo.webp" alt="Blizzard Just Confirmed GDKP Runs Won’t Be Allowed in WoW Forever" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> </div> <div class="nt-card__body" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__title" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Blizzard Just Confirmed GDKP Runs Won’t Be Allowed in WoW Forever</div> <p class="nt-card__meta" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> 1d ago by <span class="nt-card__author" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u>Neryssa</span> </p> </div> </a> </article><article data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <a href="https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/news/a-remade-invincible-and-runeforge-for-every-class-coming-in-wotlk-remix/" class="nt-card" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <div class="nt-card__media" data-astro-cid-glsgqt5u> <img src="https://wp.icy-veins.com/wp